WEBVTT

00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:30.548
Now when I heard this, I was so relieved.

00:00:31.091 --> 00:00:34.092
My classmate got an arsonist
for her first client.

00:00:34.116 --> 00:00:35.962
(Laughter)

00:00:35.986 --> 00:00:40.083
And I got a twentysomething
who wanted to talk about boys.

00:00:40.494 --> 00:00:42.621
This I thought I could handle.

00:00:43.328 --> 00:00:44.693
But I didn't handle it.

00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:48.203
With the funny stories
that Alex would bring to session,

00:00:48.227 --> 00:00:50.202
it was easy for me just to nod my head

00:00:50.226 --> 00:00:52.392
while we kicked the can down the road.

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:54.672
"Thirty's the new 20," Alex would say,

00:00:54.696 --> 00:00:57.258
and as far as I could tell, she was right.

00:00:57.726 --> 00:00:59.952
Work happened later,
marriage happened later,

00:00:59.976 --> 00:01:03.418
kids happened later,
even death happened later.